<section class="ab" id="ask-the-bench" aria-labelledby="ab-title">
<div class="ab-mat" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="ab-wrap">
<div class="ab-intro">
<p class="ab-kicker"><span class="ab-led" aria-hidden="true"></span>Ask the bench</p>
<h2 id="ab-title">Still stuck? Describe it. I’ll answer.</h2>
<p class="ab-lede">Tell me what the device is doing and what you’ve already tried. I read every question at the bench in Hailey and reply by email. There’s no charge to ask.</p>
<ol class="ab-steps">
<li><span class="ab-step-no">01</span><div><strong>Describe the symptom</strong><span>Lights, sounds, the exact words on screen, and what happened right before.</span></div></li>
<li><span class="ab-step-no">02</span><div><strong>Get a straight read</strong><span>Whether it sounds like a setting, a worn part, or a board-level fault.</span></div></li>
<li><span class="ab-step-no">03</span><div><strong>Help the next person</strong><span>Good questions can become guides here, published without your name or email.</span></div></li>
</ol>
<p class="ab-alt">Need it fixed, not explained? <a href="/mail-in-repair">Start a mail-in repair</a> or text <a href="sms:+12084501606">208-450-1606</a>.</p>
</div>
<form class="ab-ticket" data-ask-bench data-formspree="xbdvwbnr" action="https://formspree.io/f/xbdvwbnr" method="POST" novalidate>
<div class="ab-ticket-head" aria-hidden="true"><span>Bench question</span><span class="ab-ticket-no">Q&#8202;·&#8202;<span data-ab-ticket>new</span></span></div>
<div class="ab-ticket-body" data-ab-body>
<fieldset class="ab-field ab-devices" aria-describedby="ab-device-error">
<legend>What is it?</legend>
<div class="ab-chips">
<label class="ab-chip"><input type="radio" name="device" value="Phone" required><span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="6.5" y="2.5" width="11" height="19" rx="2.5"/><path d="M10.5 18.5h3"/></svg>Phone</span></label>
<label class="ab-chip"><input type="radio" name="device" value="Tablet"><span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3.5" y="3.5" width="17" height="17" rx="2.5"/><path d="M10.5 17.5h3"/></svg>Tablet</span></label>
<label class="ab-chip"><input type="radio" name="device" value="Laptop"><span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4.5" y="5" width="15" height="10.5" rx="1.5"/><path d="M2.5 18.5h19"/></svg>Laptop</span></label>
<label class="ab-chip"><input type="radio" name="device" value="Desktop or monitor"><span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="12" rx="1.5"/><path d="M9 20h6M12 16v4"/></svg>Desktop</span></label>
<label class="ab-chip"><input type="radio" name="device" value="Game console"><span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7.5 8h9a4 4 0 0 1 3.9 4.9l-.9 4a2.2 2.2 0 0 1-3.8 1L14 16h-4l-1.7 1.9a2.2 2.2 0 0 1-3.8-1l-.9-4A4 4 0 0 1 7.5 8Z"/><path d="M8 11v3M6.5 12.5h3M15.5 12h.01M17 13.5h.01"/></svg>Console</span></label>
<label class="ab-chip"><input type="radio" name="device" value="Something else"><span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"/><path d="M9.8 9.6a2.3 2.3 0 1 1 3.3 2.1c-.7.4-1.1.9-1.1 1.7v.4M12 16.8h.01"/></svg>Other</span></label>
</div>
<p class="ab-error" id="ab-device-error" hidden>Pick the closest match.</p>
</fieldset>
<div class="ab-field">
<label for="ab-model">Make and model <span class="ab-opt">if you know it</span></label>
<input id="ab-model" name="model" type="text" maxlength="120" autocomplete="off" placeholder="iPhone 13, MacBook Pro 2017, PS5 Slim">
</div>
<div class="ab-field">
<label for="ab-symptom">What’s it doing?</label>
<textarea id="ab-symptom" name="symptom" rows="4" minlength="20" maxlength="2000" required aria-describedby="ab-symptom-hint ab-symptom-error" placeholder="Turns on, the logo flashes, then the screen goes black. Started after it slid off the counter."></textarea>
<p class="ab-hint" id="ab-symptom-hint"><span>Lights, sounds and exact error messages help most.</span><span class="ab-count" data-ab-count aria-hidden="true"></span></p>
<p class="ab-error" id="ab-symptom-error" hidden>A sentence or two about what it’s doing, please.</p>
</div>
<div class="ab-field">
<label for="ab-tried">What have you tried? <span class="ab-opt">optional</span></label>
<textarea id="ab-tried" name="tried" rows="2" maxlength="1200" placeholder="Different charger, held the power button for 30 seconds"></textarea>
</div>
<div class="ab-field">
<label for="ab-email">Your email</label>
<input id="ab-email" name="email" type="email" inputmode="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="160" required aria-describedby="ab-email-hint ab-email-error" placeholder="you@example.com">
<p class="ab-hint" id="ab-email-hint">Only used to reply. If a photo would help, I’ll ask for one.</p>
<p class="ab-error" id="ab-email-error" hidden>That email doesn’t look right.</p>
</div>
<label class="ab-private"><input type="checkbox" name="keep_private" value="Yes, answer privately only"><span class="ab-check" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Keep my question private. Just answer me.</span></label>
<div class="ab-hp" aria-hidden="true"><label for="ab-gotcha">Leave this empty</label><input id="ab-gotcha" name="_gotcha" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></div>
<input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Ask the bench question">
<input type="hidden" name="form" value="Ask the bench">
<div class="ab-send">
<button class="ab-btn" type="submit"><span data-ab-label>Send to the bench</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h13M13 6.5 18.5 12 13 17.5"/></svg></button>
<p class="ab-fine">Answered questions may be published as guides on this site, without your name or email.</p>
</div>
<p class="ab-status" data-ab-status role="alert" hidden></p>
</div>
<div class="ab-done" data-ab-done tabindex="-1" hidden>
<span class="ab-stamp" aria-hidden="true">Logged</span>
<h3>Question’s on the bench.</h3>
<p>I’ll reply to <strong data-ab-email>your email</strong>. If it turns out to need hands-on work, mail-in repair works from anywhere in Idaho.</p>
<div class="ab-done-links"><a href="/mail-in-repair">How mail-in repair works <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h13M13 6.5 18.5 12 13 17.5"/></svg></a><a href="/tips">Browse the repair library <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h13M13 6.5 18.5 12 13 17.5"/></svg></a></div>
</div>
</form>
</div>
</section>
